Bugs/Issues
  - Screen clears when pshd_y is <3
  - Show color no worky when small
  - Menu is off screen when dim_y = 1

features for v1.0.0
  - preflight_check (and config options)
  - builtin function to display all user-mapped commands
  - builtin function to quickedit pshd file using $EDITOR
  - make install

features for v1.1+
  - optional single menu mode [launch into a menu]
  - full command list option
  - ability to pass args to commands
  - Scale menu sizes to longest menu entry
  - consume config function

feature req for 2.0.0
  - remove END_OF_MENU requirement by introducing vector structures

--- 0.9.2 Release Notes ---
Bugs Fixed since 0.9.1
  - pshd no longer highlighted when pshd = 3
  - hd[] no longer showing bold color in small mode when hd_c_bold is false
  - Parent menu artifacts now disappear when entering submenus
  - shutter_slide now uses fg_c
  - hd_offset_y positions hd[] in the correct direction

New Quirks
  Makefile autoloads reload_cmd to PWD when generating config.h

